{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39873","headline":"偶书 · 徐夤","name":"偶书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巧者多爲拙者资，良筹第一在乘时。\n市门逐利终身饱，谷口躬耕尽日饥。\n琼玖鬻来燕石贵，蓬蒿芳处楚兰衰。\n高皇冷笑重瞳客，盖世拔山何所爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}